Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.01,0:17:05.97,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好香哦 好像很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:09.46,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,木葉小姐 要不要稍微繞個路去吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:11.40,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,怎麼已經在吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:18.23,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnHYQiHei 75S\fs56\bord3\c&H102845&\3c&H22689D&\pos(508.286,174.884)}尋人啟事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:18.23,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnHYQiHei 75S\bord1\fax0.2\fs28\c&H033250&\3c&H37ABD4&\frz350.4\pos(670,330)}姓名    {\fnFOT-Seurat ProN B}○△□
